WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:08.920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:34.880 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:43.200 --> 01:44.160
Your Ladyship.

01:44.240 --> 01:45.600
There's been a murder at the estate.

01:45.680 --> 01:47.400
We should turn the suspect
over to the authorities.

01:47.480 --> 01:50.080
Even if we question the suspect,
vigilante justice is not permitted.

01:50.160 --> 01:51.240
Why not?

01:54.880 --> 01:57.280
Your Ladyship, this is your land.

01:57.360 --> 01:58.000
AS THE SUN RISES

01:58.080 --> 01:59.800
Even the local officials
need your permission

02:00.440 --> 02:02.040
before they can arrest a suspect here.

02:02.640 --> 02:05.920
Feng Sheng,
what if you hand over the suspect

02:06.000 --> 02:07.800
and someone kills him to keep him quiet?

02:08.800 --> 02:10.400
There's more to this than meets the eye.

02:11.039 --> 02:12.680
We need to question
more than just the craftsmen.

02:13.280 --> 02:16.720
Every maid serving Her Ladyship
must be questioned, too.

02:18.080 --> 02:19.440
I don't know anything!

02:19.520 --> 02:20.560
I don't know anything!

02:20.640 --> 02:22.640
-I don't know anything!
-I'm innocent!

02:22.720 --> 02:24.000
I'm innocent!

02:26.880 --> 02:30.080
Gejin, you share a room with Chilan.

02:30.160 --> 02:32.080
She never came back last night.

02:32.600 --> 02:34.000
And you didn't notice?

02:34.080 --> 02:37.720
Your Ladyship,
Chilan, Siyu, and I share a room.

02:38.320 --> 02:40.640
Chilan was supposed to be on night patrol.

02:40.720 --> 02:42.080
When I got up last night,
she wasn't there.

02:42.680 --> 02:45.440
I just assumed she was still on duty.

02:45.520 --> 02:47.000
Chilan is very hardworking.

02:47.080 --> 02:48.000
Even when she's not on duty,

02:48.080 --> 02:51.320
she often goes out alone at night
to inspect every corner of the estate.

02:51.400 --> 02:53.840
She checks that the tea room stove is out.

02:53.920 --> 02:55.760
She's the last to bed and first to rise.

02:56.360 --> 02:57.520
But somehow, she…

02:57.600 --> 02:59.440
Question all of you together,

03:00.280 --> 03:01.440
and we'll find out, won't we?

03:02.800 --> 03:04.120
We've gotten to the bottom of it.

03:05.320 --> 03:07.200
A bandit had slipped into the estate.

03:07.720 --> 03:12.720
He was stealing valuables
when Chilan caught him, so he killed her.

03:13.520 --> 03:14.960
Just a bandit? That's all?

03:15.040 --> 03:16.360
What else could it be?

03:17.080 --> 03:18.640
We've taken in so many refugees.

03:18.720 --> 03:19.600
All sorts of people have come here.

03:20.680 --> 03:22.960
I've ordered the steward
to question every refugee.

03:23.880 --> 03:25.160
We can't let another thief slip in.

03:33.560 --> 03:35.320
You're dismissed.

03:41.560 --> 03:42.720
You two may leave as well.

03:54.720 --> 03:58.200
Wei Rao, there's something important
you need to see tonight.

03:58.960 --> 03:59.840
Tonight?

03:59.920 --> 04:01.880
Yes. We'll go after dark.

04:46.560 --> 04:47.800
They're copper coins.

04:47.880 --> 04:52.040
The craftsman named Ben
is actually a servant of the Han family.

04:52.120 --> 04:54.120
Once the edict came down,
the estate changes hands.

04:54.200 --> 04:56.200
the Hans only had time
to move some of their wealth.

04:56.280 --> 04:59.640
He was ordered to stay behind
and guard what was left in the vault.

04:59.720 --> 05:04.920
Last night, he crawled out of the cellar
and ran into Chilan.

05:05.000 --> 05:06.240
Afraid she'd discover his secret,

05:06.320 --> 05:07.960
he killed her without mercy.

05:09.360 --> 05:11.000
The Han family! Again!

05:11.960 --> 05:13.120
It was so dark.

05:13.200 --> 05:14.320
Chilan might not have seen a thing.

05:14.920 --> 05:17.080
But they knew they were guilty.

05:17.160 --> 05:19.920
They'd rather kill an innocent
than take a chance.

05:22.080 --> 05:24.240
And Chilan wasn't his only victim.

05:25.000 --> 05:27.840
There are two more bodies buried
in the woods southeast of the fields.

05:27.920 --> 05:30.560
Seven days ago, a father and son
caught him contacting someone outside,

05:31.080 --> 05:32.320
so he killed them.

05:33.880 --> 05:39.320
If Chilan's body hadn't surfaced,
even more innocent people would have died.

05:40.400 --> 05:42.600
Zhao Bai. Go see what else is in there.

05:47.120 --> 05:48.560
Carry these two chests out first.

05:51.280 --> 05:53.640
My Lord, there are
over a dozen more chests inside.

06:12.480 --> 06:14.600
No wonder Han Liao
wouldn't leave us alone.

06:16.360 --> 06:17.800
So that's what he was after.

06:18.520 --> 06:19.560
What are you going to do with it?

06:20.160 --> 06:21.200
Isn't it obvious?

06:21.280 --> 06:23.400
We've taken in so many refugees.

06:23.480 --> 06:24.920
The court's aid barely covers anything.

06:25.640 --> 06:26.720
Clearing new farmland
won't feed them right away.

06:27.320 --> 06:28.840
We have so many hungry mouths to feed.

06:29.520 --> 06:31.960
The Han family's fortune…
It was all stolen from the people.

06:32.040 --> 06:33.520
What's wrong with giving it back to them?

06:34.560 --> 06:37.800
Even if you kept every last coin,
would the Han family dare report you?

06:38.720 --> 06:40.880
-They'd have to swallow the loss.
-Qi Zhongkai.

06:41.560 --> 06:42.800
Don't act so noble.

06:42.880 --> 06:45.080
Who'd willingly give away
a fortune in gold?

06:45.160 --> 06:46.760
Only a complete fool!

06:48.120 --> 06:49.160
Wei Rao.

06:50.800 --> 06:52.480
This money could feed
and support your people.

06:53.440 --> 06:55.600
Han Liao wouldn't dare
openly demand the gold back.

06:56.200 --> 06:57.560
But he won't just let it go.

06:58.360 --> 06:59.960
If you want to keep this gold,

07:02.320 --> 07:03.400
we'll need a clever plan.

07:14.000 --> 07:17.320
Move these gold bars
out of the cellar in batches.

07:18.600 --> 07:19.960
Make sure no outsiders find out.

07:21.800 --> 07:24.720
Then seal up the piles of copper coins
exactly as they are.

07:27.920 --> 07:31.240
So this vault
contains only gold and copper coins?

07:32.640 --> 07:34.040
Nothing else?

07:36.720 --> 07:37.920
What else would there be?

07:38.920 --> 07:39.960
We can make sure there will be.

07:42.960 --> 07:44.920
Zhao Bai, I need you to do something.

07:48.960 --> 07:49.960
Yes, My Lord.

07:50.480 --> 07:52.400
What are you two
being so mysterious about?

07:53.400 --> 07:56.560
There's nothing I love more than gold.

07:57.600 --> 07:59.800
Lord Han has given me
such a generous gift.

08:00.440 --> 08:02.880
It's only right that I return the favor.

08:03.520 --> 08:05.000
And the gift I have for him…

08:09.240 --> 08:11.160
I hope he can handle it.

08:16.080 --> 08:19.640
By the heir's orders, no one may approach
the cellar from this day forward!

08:19.720 --> 08:21.600
Violators will face military punishment.

08:21.680 --> 08:23.000
Yes!

08:23.080 --> 08:24.920
What if Her Ladyship finds out?

08:25.000 --> 08:27.120
No. I can't stay here any longer.

08:30.600 --> 08:32.600
Lady Li heard what happened at my estate.

08:33.360 --> 08:34.960
She worried I
might be short on reliable help,

08:35.880 --> 08:37.120
so she sent Aman to me.

08:37.799 --> 08:40.600
From now on, she'll take Chilan's place.

08:40.679 --> 08:42.159
You'll all follow her orders.

08:43.080 --> 08:43.919
Yes, Your Ladyship.

08:45.240 --> 08:46.360
Gejin.

08:46.880 --> 08:48.760
Aman is new here.

08:48.840 --> 08:49.800
Make sure you show her the ropes.

08:50.480 --> 08:51.840
Yes, Your Ladyship.

08:51.920 --> 08:54.160
His Majesty
is visiting Shanglin Park today.

08:54.240 --> 08:55.280
I must go there as well.

08:56.160 --> 08:57.160
You all stay and look after the estate.

08:57.760 --> 08:59.240
Now, get back to work.

08:59.880 --> 09:01.400
-Yes, Your Ladyship.
-Yes, Your Ladyship.

09:18.080 --> 09:19.960
Your Ladyship,
the compensation for Chilan's family

09:20.680 --> 09:22.120
has been delivered as you instructed.

09:22.680 --> 09:25.920
Aman. I can't trust
the people at this estate.

09:26.000 --> 09:28.760
There's someone
I need you to keep an eye on.

09:59.360 --> 10:01.080
I've lost contact with my spy.

10:01.760 --> 10:05.320
I trust you can tell me
what happened at the estate.

10:06.000 --> 10:08.320
Her Ladyship had a craftsman arrested.

10:09.440 --> 10:11.280
He… he killed Chilan.

10:19.560 --> 10:21.440
Then why are you running?

10:28.880 --> 10:30.360
Please don't kill me, My Lord!

10:30.440 --> 10:32.320
I'll tell you everything!

10:32.400 --> 10:34.400
Tell me everything Her Ladyship
has been doing.

10:34.480 --> 10:36.440
Don't leave out a single detail.

10:39.520 --> 10:42.720
ZHAO

10:45.720 --> 10:47.720
That's amazing.

10:53.320 --> 10:55.240
-Yes, indeed.
-Bravo.

10:56.600 --> 10:59.360
-They've got some real tricks!
-Good moves!

11:00.240 --> 11:01.880
Bravo!

11:02.640 --> 11:03.600
-Look at that!
-Wow!

11:03.680 --> 11:05.680
-That's amazing!
-This one's beautiful, too!

11:22.520 --> 11:25.680
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

11:31.160 --> 11:33.480
Such incredible strength! Reward him!

11:59.440 --> 12:01.840
-Enemies!
-Father!

12:02.440 --> 12:04.960
Enemies! Kill!

12:05.040 --> 12:06.720
-Your Majesty!
-Protect His Majesty!

12:07.720 --> 12:08.680
Charge!

12:12.640 --> 12:14.520
-Protect His Majesty!
-Your Majesty, watch out!

12:14.600 --> 12:15.840
-Protect His Majesty!
-Protect His Majesty!

12:24.520 --> 12:25.680
Mother!

12:26.240 --> 12:27.560
Shuo!

12:45.680 --> 12:46.880
Go!

12:51.160 --> 12:53.200
I failed in my duty. Forgive me for
putting you in danger, Your Majesty.

13:31.600 --> 13:32.960
It was a test.

13:35.280 --> 13:37.120
A test for the princes.

13:53.040 --> 13:56.080
FURONG HALL

13:56.160 --> 13:59.720
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

14:13.200 --> 14:15.560
-Leave us.
-Yes, Your Highness.

14:18.440 --> 14:22.240
Mother. These are all rewards
from Grandmother and Father.

14:22.920 --> 14:25.800
But how did you know it was a test?

14:25.880 --> 14:27.240
For the past six months,

14:27.320 --> 14:30.440
officials have repeatedly urged
His Majesty to name a crown prince.

14:31.320 --> 14:34.000
Of His Majesty's four sons,

14:34.640 --> 14:37.680
Prince Jing was adopted by the Empress.

14:38.720 --> 14:40.640
He has the advantage of being the eldest.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.720
But when it comes to governing
and military strategy,

14:43.240 --> 14:44.120
he's nowhere near your equal.

14:44.840 --> 14:47.680
Prince Fu has used
the Wang family's wealth and influence

14:47.760 --> 14:51.000
to win over many court officials
who now speak on his behalf.

14:52.360 --> 14:55.480
Liu Shuo is the youngest,
and he's reckless and unruly.

14:56.360 --> 14:59.600
On the surface, he seems
the least fit to inherit the throne.

15:00.600 --> 15:04.880
But he happens to have
a mother who enjoys the Emperor's favor.

15:05.480 --> 15:07.800
The court officials can't agree,

15:09.240 --> 15:11.840
and His Majesty struggles to decide.

15:14.120 --> 15:17.000
Your uncle has been watching closely

15:17.080 --> 15:18.160
for unusual activity
in the palace and army.

15:18.760 --> 15:21.360
He knew His Majesty
would put the princes to the test.

15:22.320 --> 15:24.360
When I become crown prince,

15:24.440 --> 15:26.680
I'll never forget all my grandfather
and uncle have done for me.

15:30.200 --> 15:31.440
Did you see that clearly?

15:31.520 --> 15:34.240
Lady Li had eyes for no one else.

15:34.760 --> 15:35.720
She went straight for Liu Shuo?

15:38.520 --> 15:40.920
The assassins were after the throne.

15:41.600 --> 15:45.200
Liu Shuo was too close to the danger,
and Wei Rao was too far away.

15:48.640 --> 15:50.920
Then you don't understand people at all.

15:51.600 --> 15:53.760
A child abandoned by her mother

15:53.840 --> 15:56.320
would never forgive her a second time.

15:58.040 --> 16:02.560
It looks like Zhaoyang Palace
is in for another family feud.

16:06.600 --> 16:09.760
Yes. You're very wise, Mother.

16:10.880 --> 16:12.000
Be gentle.

16:13.960 --> 16:16.440
Ow! That hurts…

16:18.120 --> 16:21.880
SPLENDID AS BLOSSOMS

16:21.960 --> 16:22.800
What did His Majesty say?

16:23.400 --> 16:25.200
He's ordered that no one
be allowed to see him.

16:30.240 --> 16:31.400
How is it?

16:31.480 --> 16:32.880
Come here. Let Mother have a look.

16:32.960 --> 16:34.080
It hurts.

16:35.000 --> 16:36.440
His Majesty really went too far.

16:36.520 --> 16:39.640
If he wanted to test his sons' character,
he should've warned us first.

16:40.240 --> 16:41.400
Look what he's put you through.

16:42.120 --> 16:43.800
My poor boy!

16:43.880 --> 16:45.240
If he'd practiced his fighting skills,

16:45.320 --> 16:47.200
he could've been the hero today.

16:47.280 --> 16:49.640
Lady Li, you keep spoiling your son

16:50.360 --> 16:52.320
without thinking about the trouble ahead.

16:53.760 --> 16:55.160
His Majesty refuses to see anyone.

16:55.840 --> 16:57.280
He must be upset about what happened.

16:57.800 --> 16:59.120
Shuo is still so young.

16:59.200 --> 17:01.120
He's your own brother.

17:01.200 --> 17:02.520
Instead of worrying about his safety,

17:02.600 --> 17:03.680
all you can think about is scheming.

17:04.319 --> 17:06.400
Besides,
His Majesty deliberately tested them

17:06.480 --> 17:08.319
by ordering the guards
to lower their defenses.

17:08.400 --> 17:10.680
The men they let in
were desperate killers.

17:10.760 --> 17:12.560
And you still wanted him to play the hero?

17:12.640 --> 17:15.000
You might as well wish him dead!

17:15.839 --> 17:17.280
You're so petty, Rao.

17:17.359 --> 17:18.200
You're just jealous.

17:18.280 --> 17:20.760
It was dangerous out there,
and you were too far away.

17:20.839 --> 17:21.839
How could Mother possibly get to you?

17:23.119 --> 17:24.599
If I'd been the one in danger,

17:24.680 --> 17:26.880
would Lady Li
have left her son to save me?

17:37.920 --> 17:39.800
Mother, she resents you.

17:39.880 --> 17:41.280
She's never been on our side.

17:43.320 --> 17:45.360
What did I do to deserve this?

17:45.960 --> 17:48.920
I only scolded Shuo for being lazy
and refusing to practice.

17:49.000 --> 17:49.840
GREAT BLESSINGS, SPRING'S GRACE

17:49.920 --> 17:53.360
She accused me of being petty
and resenting my own brother.

17:54.720 --> 17:56.600
She abandoned me when I was little.

17:56.680 --> 17:58.880
And when danger struck,
she forgot about me again.

17:59.840 --> 18:01.760
Am I not her own flesh and blood?

18:02.680 --> 18:04.240
How can a mother favor one child so much?

18:08.800 --> 18:10.200
Rao.

18:10.280 --> 18:13.200
Today, His Majesty turned Lady Li away
outside Xuanshi Palace.

18:14.000 --> 18:16.200
Then the Empress Dowager
summoned her for a scolding,

18:16.280 --> 18:18.560
accusing her of raising her son poorly.

18:19.360 --> 18:21.040
She even said that
once the Fourth Prince recovers,

18:21.120 --> 18:22.560
he'll be sent to the army for training.

18:25.280 --> 18:28.920
Lady Li was just upset,
so she took it out on you.

18:29.720 --> 18:30.800
He's utterly incompetent!

18:33.600 --> 18:36.280
Lady Zheng, you heard her yourself.

18:36.800 --> 18:40.320
She blames me for
everything Shuo did wrong.

18:42.840 --> 18:47.240
Well, Shuo
has always lived with his mother.

18:47.320 --> 18:50.000
He's still young,
so naturally she dotes on him.

18:50.680 --> 18:53.640
As his older sister,
you'll have to be understanding.

18:55.240 --> 18:59.360
It breaks my heart
to see a mother and daughter at odds.

19:00.240 --> 19:01.400
Here's what we'll do.

19:01.480 --> 19:04.200
I'll host a banquet tomorrow
and invite Lady Li.

19:04.840 --> 19:07.120
I'll help you two make peace.

19:07.960 --> 19:09.880
A mother and daughter
shouldn't stay angry.

19:10.480 --> 19:12.400
Surely talking it out will settle things.

19:16.560 --> 19:19.320
Thank you, Lady Zheng.

19:22.960 --> 19:25.200
No mother loves all her children equally.

19:25.280 --> 19:28.400
The one she raised herself
will naturally be her favorite.

19:29.160 --> 19:31.080
But she's still your mother.

19:31.160 --> 19:34.400
Say a few kind words to her,
and she'll come around.

19:35.600 --> 19:39.400
Unlike me.
Being a royal daughter-in-law isn't easy.

19:39.480 --> 19:42.480
I have to watch every word
around my mother-in-law.

19:43.080 --> 19:44.040
I can't afford a single mistake.

19:44.760 --> 19:46.400
When I first married into the family,

19:47.040 --> 19:49.280
she looked down on my humble background.

19:49.800 --> 19:51.800
I had no powerful father
or brothers to support me.

19:51.880 --> 19:53.520
She found fault with everything I did.

19:54.600 --> 19:55.960
Fortunately, later on…

19:56.040 --> 19:57.160
What happened later?

20:02.480 --> 20:04.600
Master Min, who makes immortality elixirs
for the Empress Dowager,

20:04.680 --> 20:05.600
gave me a talisman.

20:06.200 --> 20:08.520
It's meant to mend ties between in-laws

20:08.600 --> 20:10.200
and keep husbands and wives from arguing.

20:11.040 --> 20:12.200
Did it work?

20:15.760 --> 20:17.040
You've been separated
from your family since childhood.

20:17.680 --> 20:18.880
Your family ties have always been fragile.

20:18.960 --> 20:22.080
So I got you a talisman
to strengthen family bonds.

20:22.760 --> 20:24.800
May it help you and your mother reconcile.

20:25.640 --> 20:27.920
Life rarely goes the way we want.

20:28.000 --> 20:31.680
You need to let go of your resentment
and open yourself up to better things.

20:32.280 --> 20:34.760
Please don't be stubborn
and turn against your mother.

20:34.840 --> 20:37.320
She's the one you can truly rely on.

20:41.760 --> 20:42.600
I understand.

20:45.520 --> 20:46.480
Thank you, Shu.

20:49.120 --> 20:50.000
JOY AND PEACE

20:59.200 --> 21:00.160
Your Ladyship.

21:00.240 --> 21:02.400
Your Ladyship,
it's a talisman for family harmony.

21:02.480 --> 21:03.600
It's common among folks.

21:03.680 --> 21:04.920
Nothing harmful about it.

21:07.200 --> 21:08.160
That's a relief.

21:09.680 --> 21:12.520
Lady Zheng is hosting a banquet tomorrow.
I must go to the palace.

21:58.000 --> 22:00.680
Hurry up. Go on.

22:45.200 --> 22:48.560
This pair of jade pendants
was a gift from His Majesty years ago.

22:49.920 --> 22:52.600
I'd like you two cousins to have them.

22:52.680 --> 22:54.040
Consider it my way of thanking

22:54.120 --> 22:56.520
Princess Consort Duan
for helping us reconcile.

22:57.240 --> 23:00.200
Lady Li, you're too kind.
I don't deserve such praise.

23:01.240 --> 23:02.720
Rao is my own cousin.

23:02.800 --> 23:03.920
I only want what's best for her.

23:04.680 --> 23:07.560
We may have kept Rao's past from others,

23:07.640 --> 23:09.560
but there's no hiding it from you two.

23:09.640 --> 23:12.920
My daughter
was brought back from outside the palace.

23:13.000 --> 23:14.840
There are many court rules
she doesn't know.

23:15.360 --> 23:17.800
I'm grateful Lady Zheng
has taken her under her wing.

23:17.880 --> 23:19.480
I should be the one thanking you.

23:20.160 --> 23:22.840
Actually, I envy you.

23:23.600 --> 23:26.320
You have such a bright,
thoughtful daughter.

23:26.400 --> 23:28.360
Unlike my son.

23:28.440 --> 23:31.400
All he ever does is practice fighting.

23:31.920 --> 23:33.200
Even on his days off,

23:33.840 --> 23:35.800
his father summons him to attend court.

23:36.640 --> 23:39.040
All I have is my daughter-in-law
to keep me company.

23:39.560 --> 23:41.520
As capable as she is,

23:42.440 --> 23:44.400
she's no substitute for a loving daughter.

23:46.480 --> 23:50.000
Yinggu. Is my gift for Lady Zheng ready?

23:50.840 --> 23:51.680
Bring it here at once.

23:52.840 --> 23:53.720
Bring it in.

23:54.240 --> 23:57.440
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

24:01.000 --> 24:02.560
What's all this?

24:03.520 --> 24:05.560
Shu, please open it and see.

24:24.160 --> 24:25.720
They're here.

24:28.200 --> 24:29.520
Rao.

24:38.520 --> 24:39.920
All of you, leave!

24:44.920 --> 24:47.720
Lady Li, I hosted this banquet
out of kindness

24:47.800 --> 24:49.160
to help you make peace.

24:49.240 --> 24:51.520
And this is how you repay me?

24:51.600 --> 24:53.800
Lady Zheng,
you've certainly thought of everything.

24:54.880 --> 24:57.320
You didn't just help us reconcile.

24:57.400 --> 24:58.920
You also had this palace maid

24:59.000 --> 25:00.280
sneak into the bedchamber
in Zhaoyang Palace

25:00.360 --> 25:01.240
SPLENDID AS BLOSSOMS

25:01.320 --> 25:02.920
and hide something rather interesting.

25:12.000 --> 25:14.000
This is an Enmity Talisman.

25:14.720 --> 25:16.680
One must slay a dam and her pups,

25:17.280 --> 25:19.960
burn their heads and
drink the ashes mixed with water.

25:20.040 --> 25:23.480
Bury the pup's bones far apart,

25:24.680 --> 25:27.920
so mother and child
shall loathe each other for all eternity.

25:30.200 --> 25:32.240
It must be a curse against
the Empress Dowager and His Majesty.

25:33.440 --> 25:34.360
This one is even worse.

25:35.280 --> 25:36.600
A Soul-Stealing Talisman.

25:37.160 --> 25:38.280
It's meant to take lifes.

25:39.480 --> 25:41.680
Whose birth details are written on it?

25:42.280 --> 25:43.880
The Empress Dowager's.

25:46.600 --> 25:47.960
Lady Zheng.

25:48.040 --> 25:50.600
You ordered a palace maid to
hide talismans in Zhaoyang Palace.

25:50.680 --> 25:54.160
Were you trying to frame Lady Li
for practicing forbidden witchcraft?

25:54.840 --> 25:55.920
How…

25:56.600 --> 25:57.800
How could…

25:57.880 --> 25:58.880
How could this happen?

26:02.160 --> 26:04.600
You even gave me a Blessing Talisman.

26:05.400 --> 26:08.240
So it seems you planned to accuse me

26:08.840 --> 26:11.080
for bringing these evil
curses into the palace.

26:13.920 --> 26:14.920
No, Rao!

26:15.760 --> 26:17.440
It wasn't me! I swear!

26:18.920 --> 26:19.960
It was Mo…

26:24.960 --> 26:26.120
I thought…

26:27.480 --> 26:30.360
Rao, I never meant to hurt you.

26:40.760 --> 26:42.480
I don't even know this palace maid.

26:43.840 --> 26:45.320
You can't pin this on me.

26:46.120 --> 26:47.680
Whether you know her doesn't matter.

26:48.360 --> 26:49.960
False accusations
are as serious as treason.

26:50.600 --> 26:52.320
Once I report this to His Majesty,

26:52.840 --> 26:54.440
I'll have her sent to
the Commandant's Office.

26:55.240 --> 26:59.160
There, the ruthless interrogator Boyao
will question her personally.

26:59.760 --> 27:02.760
I hear Boyao specializes
in torture by steaming.

27:03.280 --> 27:06.000
Perfect. Let this maid try it first.

27:06.640 --> 27:08.080
He can make the blind see,

27:08.160 --> 27:11.760
the deaf hear, and even the mute speak.

27:14.840 --> 27:15.760
You! Come forward!

27:15.840 --> 27:18.160
I was forced into it!
I'll tell you everything!

27:18.240 --> 27:20.400
Lady Li, please spare my life!
Please spare me, Lady Li!

27:21.000 --> 27:25.120
Rao. I swear to heaven
I never meant you any harm.

27:25.720 --> 27:26.920
My mother-in-law only told me

27:27.520 --> 27:30.840
that this blessing talisman
could help you and your mother reconcile.

27:31.560 --> 27:34.440
I thought I'd be doing a good deed.

27:34.520 --> 27:36.520
I never imagined it would cause
so much trouble.

27:36.600 --> 27:37.880
Please believe me, Rao!

27:37.960 --> 27:39.760
Why are you crying?

27:40.360 --> 27:41.800
You're all spineless cowards!

27:43.080 --> 27:44.560
Weren't you going to report me?

27:44.640 --> 27:45.560
Go ahead! Do it now!

27:46.360 --> 27:49.240
I refuse to believe
that some lowly palace maid

27:49.320 --> 27:52.200
could bring me down with a few words!

27:52.280 --> 27:55.600
The Zheng family
is powerful and influential.

27:55.680 --> 27:57.680
Lady Zheng is used to getting your way.

27:57.760 --> 27:59.360
Who would dare hold you accountable?

28:00.080 --> 28:04.680
But right now, His Majesty
is about to choose a crown prince.

28:05.440 --> 28:07.600
I wonder if the Empress and the Han family

28:07.680 --> 28:09.480
will seize this chance
to make things worse.

28:09.560 --> 28:11.320
And what about Lady Wang and Prince Fu?

28:11.920 --> 28:13.880
Will they take advantage of your downfall?

28:22.120 --> 28:23.880
You planned all of this.

28:31.880 --> 28:33.040
Let's go.

28:33.120 --> 28:34.760
Spare me, Your Ladyship!

28:35.760 --> 28:36.920
Don't worry, Shu.

28:37.680 --> 28:39.440
Lady Li is generous and forgiving.

28:39.960 --> 28:42.120
She didn't drag the maid
before His Majesty

28:42.200 --> 28:44.800
because she cares
about Prince Duan's reputation.

28:51.320 --> 28:52.200
No wonder.

28:53.280 --> 28:55.000
I knew this plan to lure the culprit out

28:55.600 --> 28:57.440
wasn't something Lady Li
would come up with.

28:58.200 --> 29:00.280
Whenever she feels slighted,

29:00.360 --> 29:03.720
she runs to His Majesty and acts helpless.

29:03.800 --> 29:05.000
She's so used to being spoiled

29:06.040 --> 29:08.040
that she'd never hold her anger
in for this long.

29:08.960 --> 29:12.440
You've certainly outdone your elders.

29:13.040 --> 29:16.720
Compared to your mother,
you're a little more capable.

29:21.240 --> 29:23.440
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

29:23.520 --> 29:24.880
You're too kind, Your Ladyship.

29:25.920 --> 29:28.600
My younger brother
has always been a troublemaker.

29:28.680 --> 29:29.680
He's no good at books or fighting.

29:30.520 --> 29:31.840
As for the crown prince's position,

29:35.040 --> 29:37.560
Prince Duan is clearly the only choice.

29:41.360 --> 29:43.640
Lady Li would gladly lend her support.

29:43.720 --> 29:44.560
But…

29:46.440 --> 29:47.560
But what?

29:47.640 --> 29:49.360
The Empress rules over the inner palace.

29:50.040 --> 29:52.240
The Han family fully supports Prince Jing,

29:52.320 --> 29:54.320
and the Empress Dowager backs him, too.

29:54.400 --> 29:56.280
So the crown prince's position…

29:56.360 --> 29:57.680
The Empress…

29:58.480 --> 30:02.080
Noble Lady Wu'an,
you certainly hold a grudge.

30:06.440 --> 30:11.120
I wonder, though,
what you think, Lady Zheng.

30:12.680 --> 30:13.520
I…

30:20.520 --> 30:24.320
Of course we should join forces,
dear sister.

30:34.200 --> 30:37.040
Your cousin is so cunning,
yet you saw none of it!

30:37.560 --> 30:38.880
You've brought shame upon Mother.

30:39.480 --> 30:40.800
Apologize to her at once!

30:43.880 --> 30:46.800
It was my carelessness.
Please forgive me, Mother.

30:46.880 --> 30:47.960
Please forgive me!

30:48.880 --> 30:51.600
Enough. Spare your hands.

30:53.480 --> 30:56.080
Mother, do you mean we're really
going to ally ourselves with them?

30:56.680 --> 30:57.800
After they played us for fools?

31:01.520 --> 31:02.720
My son is a man of rare talent,

31:03.320 --> 31:04.320
truly born to stand above the rest.

31:04.920 --> 31:07.280
Who else deserves
to be crown prince but you?

31:08.480 --> 31:11.240
If I must suffer a little humiliation
for your sake,

31:11.320 --> 31:12.280
what does it matter?

31:13.840 --> 31:17.600
Once you become crown prince,
we'll have our chance to settle the score.

31:18.600 --> 31:19.600
I knew it.

31:20.600 --> 31:23.040
You're the only person in this world
who truly cares about me, Mother.

31:25.080 --> 31:28.160
As for everyone else,
I can't count on them at all.

31:30.400 --> 31:33.120
Did Noble Lady Wu'an say
what we should do next?

31:34.360 --> 31:38.080
They said the Zheng family
should hold off for now.

31:38.160 --> 31:40.920
Let the court officials recommend
Prince Jing as crown prince.

31:41.000 --> 31:43.080
Recommend my eldest brother
as crown prince?

31:43.720 --> 31:44.560
Did she really say that?

31:57.400 --> 31:58.320
Keep up. Hurry.

32:22.840 --> 32:24.040
Lord Han.

32:25.240 --> 32:27.440
They carried seven or eight chests
out of the cellar.

32:27.520 --> 32:28.920
Every chest was heavy.

32:29.000 --> 32:30.320
Aman was there to receive them,

32:30.400 --> 32:32.240
and they took everything
into the storeroom.

32:32.320 --> 32:34.320
-Are you certain?
-I saw it myself, my lord.

32:34.400 --> 32:35.240
I wouldn't dare lie.

32:37.080 --> 32:40.680
I remember
Noble Lady Wu'an took in some refugees

32:40.760 --> 32:42.200
and earned praise from the court.

32:42.800 --> 32:45.080
His Majesty even granted her money
and grain from the treasury.

32:45.160 --> 32:46.080
That's right.

32:47.800 --> 32:50.280
Since I can't get my gold back,

32:50.360 --> 32:52.600
I might as well put it to good use.

32:55.040 --> 33:00.560
Noble Lady Wu'an, my family's fortune
isn't yours for the taking.

33:01.480 --> 33:04.200
Lord Han, you promised me yourself

33:04.280 --> 33:07.000
that you'd make me your concubine
once this was done.

33:07.640 --> 33:10.000
I'll serve you faithfully from then on.

33:11.480 --> 33:13.520
That depends on

33:14.400 --> 33:16.480
how well you carry out your task.

33:17.480 --> 33:19.360
I'll do everything I can, My Lord.

33:25.360 --> 33:26.200
COMMANDANT'S OFFICE

33:26.280 --> 33:29.520
-What's she beating that drum for?
-Yeah, what's this about?

33:29.600 --> 33:31.000
-What happened to her?
-Right.

33:31.080 --> 33:32.200
What happened?

33:33.840 --> 33:35.520
My lord, that's her.

33:37.800 --> 33:40.320
My lord! I wish to accuse
Noble Lady Wu'an, Wei Rao,

33:40.400 --> 33:42.440
of outrageous greed
and stealing relief funds and grain!

33:42.520 --> 33:44.560
-How can she do such a thing?
-Really? Is she?

33:44.640 --> 33:46.640
I knew it. She's skimming off our money.

33:46.720 --> 33:48.280
-Exactly!
-How awful!

33:49.400 --> 33:52.400
Your Majesty, wise rulers have always
put the realm's welfare first.

33:53.000 --> 33:55.040
They know the succession must come first.

33:55.120 --> 33:57.360
A rightful heir
gives the people peace of mind.

33:57.440 --> 33:59.520
Prince Jing is Your Majesty's eldest son.

33:59.600 --> 34:01.600
He is kind, humble, frugal,
and devoted to his people.

34:02.200 --> 34:05.480
I humbly ask Your Majesty
to heed the people's wishes

34:05.560 --> 34:07.280
and name Prince Jing crown prince,

34:07.360 --> 34:10.960
securing the throne
and reassuring the people.

34:13.239 --> 34:16.719
Who else among you
supports Prince Jing as crown prince?

34:16.800 --> 34:20.360
We all support Prince Jing!

34:21.520 --> 34:25.280
You mean you advised
the Zheng family to stay out of it

34:26.040 --> 34:29.639
and let the ministers
push for the Empress's son?

34:30.320 --> 34:33.000
His Majesty is blessed
by heaven and still in his prime.

34:33.840 --> 34:35.120
He's in no hurry to name an heir.

34:35.800 --> 34:38.840
The harder they push,
the angrier he'll become.

34:42.760 --> 34:45.280
Naming a crown prince
is a matter of great importance.

34:45.360 --> 34:47.760
We shall discuss it another day.

34:49.560 --> 34:50.960
Do you have anything else to report?

34:54.040 --> 34:57.480
Your Majesty, Noble Lady Wu'an
is arrogant and overbearing.

34:57.560 --> 34:58.480
She abuses her power without restraint.

34:58.560 --> 35:00.760
She secretly tortured her maid, Gejin.

35:00.840 --> 35:03.080
Covered in wounds,
Gejin fled to the Commandant's Office.

35:03.160 --> 35:05.040
She publicly accused her mistress

35:05.120 --> 35:08.360
of stealing the court's
disaster relief funds and grain.

35:08.960 --> 35:11.120
Lord Han failed to
win Noble Lady Wu'an's hand

35:11.200 --> 35:12.960
and was wounded by
the Thousand-Bolt Crossbow.

35:13.600 --> 35:15.520
He must still hold a grudge.

35:15.600 --> 35:16.560
Now, without a shred of evidence,

35:17.160 --> 35:18.680
he accuses Her Ladyship
of stealing relief supplies.

35:19.280 --> 35:21.680
One might suspect he's seeking revenge

35:22.280 --> 35:24.200
and question his integrity as an official.

35:24.840 --> 35:25.840
Your Majesty.

35:25.920 --> 35:28.120
I speak only in the interest of justice,
with no personal grudge.

35:28.840 --> 35:31.280
Your Majesty granted relief funds
to help those in need.

35:31.360 --> 35:35.200
If someone truly dared
to line their pockets with that money,

35:35.800 --> 35:37.760
even a hundred executions
wouldn't be enough!

35:38.480 --> 35:41.760
Your Majesty, don't believe
these baseless accusations!

35:41.840 --> 35:42.920
Your Majesty!

35:43.000 --> 35:45.000
Hundreds of refugees have gathered
at the Commandant's Office,

35:45.080 --> 35:45.920
causing an uproar.

35:46.600 --> 35:48.360
Rumors are spreading
throughout the capital.

35:48.960 --> 35:52.120
I request permission
to take troops to Zhuyu Estate.

35:52.200 --> 35:54.320
If Noble Lady Wu'an is truly innocent,

35:54.400 --> 35:59.120
we can clear her name before everyone
and put the people at ease.

36:01.640 --> 36:03.040
Qi Zhongkai.

36:03.120 --> 36:05.000
Take troops with Han Liao
and accompany the Commandant

36:05.080 --> 36:06.320
to investigate this matter.

36:06.920 --> 36:07.960
As you command.

36:14.800 --> 36:17.200
ZHUYU ESTATE

36:19.960 --> 36:20.800
It's all in there.

36:20.880 --> 36:22.680
I saw it with my own eyes.

36:22.760 --> 36:26.240
They exchanged the stolen relief funds
and grain for gold bars.

36:26.320 --> 36:28.480
You shameless wretch.

36:28.560 --> 36:29.520
Her Ladyship has always treated you well.

36:30.120 --> 36:31.800
How dare you betray her
and falsely accuse your mistress?

36:33.040 --> 36:36.280
Whether I am telling the truth
will be clear once we open the storeroom.

36:37.440 --> 36:38.800
Her Ladyship receives
only a modest allowance.

36:39.400 --> 36:41.120
How could she have a treasury?

36:41.200 --> 36:44.160
My lord. There's a whole mountain
of coins inside.

36:44.800 --> 36:45.840
Break it open!

36:50.120 --> 36:51.760
Do you think the people will believe

36:52.360 --> 36:57.040
that the kind and generous
Noble Lady Wu'an is innocent?

36:57.120 --> 36:58.480
No one will believe her now.

36:59.920 --> 37:02.000
From now on, every coin in her storeroom

37:02.080 --> 37:04.080
will be seen as wealth
wrung from the poor,

37:04.680 --> 37:06.120
stolen from disaster relief funds.

37:06.200 --> 37:10.400
Her spotless reputation
will be stained beyond repair.

37:11.280 --> 37:15.440
And this refuge she worked so hard
and sacrificed so much to build

37:16.360 --> 37:19.880
will be destroyed by vicious rumors
and reduced to nothing in an instant.

37:20.760 --> 37:23.520
All because of that gold and money,

37:24.720 --> 37:27.080
she'll lose the people's trust
and become a public enemy.

37:27.680 --> 37:28.800
Han Liao.

37:29.480 --> 37:31.320
How utterly despicable you are.

37:32.280 --> 37:33.160
And how cruel.

37:34.640 --> 37:36.280
The refugees have nowhere else to go.

37:36.840 --> 37:38.760
And you want to destroy their only home!

37:38.840 --> 37:40.280
You see right through me.

37:41.000 --> 37:42.520
Just what I'd expect from Lord Lu.

37:43.120 --> 37:44.960
She has only herself
to blame for rejecting me

37:45.040 --> 37:48.240
-and wasting my sincere affection!
-You shameless

37:48.320 --> 37:49.840
despicable cur!

37:50.440 --> 37:54.640
What a cur can't have,
he'll destroy completely!

37:55.240 --> 37:56.400
Found it! We found it!

38:09.240 --> 38:11.480
Lord Commandant, take a look.

38:12.320 --> 38:15.520
Everyone here,
come and see for yourselves!

38:17.720 --> 38:19.120
Look at this Noble Lady Wu'an,

38:19.200 --> 38:21.480
so kind to the poor and elderly,
practically a saint!

38:22.080 --> 38:24.840
See how much she's stolen from the people!

38:56.680 --> 38:57.680
Look closely.

38:58.440 --> 39:00.720
Are these gold bars or copper coins?

39:01.240 --> 39:02.360
You scoundrel, Han.

39:03.240 --> 39:05.600
Is this the fortune you claim
she stole from the people?

39:18.120 --> 39:20.200
Open it! Open every last one!

39:30.360 --> 39:32.840
Noble Lady Wu'an, what… What are these?

39:33.440 --> 39:34.920
Winters are long and bitterly cold.

39:35.640 --> 39:37.440
The refugees don't have enough
warm clothing.

39:37.520 --> 39:39.720
Noble Lady Wu'an entrusted
Princess Consort Duan

39:39.800 --> 39:41.440
to collect those from noble households.

39:42.240 --> 39:45.440
The ladies also generously donated
old jewelry, antiques, and ornaments.

39:46.040 --> 39:49.720
The stolen goods aren't in the storeroom
because you knew we were coming!

39:50.320 --> 39:52.360
My men have been guarding
the estate's entrance.

39:52.960 --> 39:55.320
There's no way
you could've taken the money out.

39:55.400 --> 39:57.360
Search the whole estate,
and we'll find it.

39:58.400 --> 40:00.080
Search! Keep searching!

40:01.360 --> 40:02.200
Lord Bo.

40:07.040 --> 40:08.600
I found a cellar.

40:08.680 --> 40:10.040
There's a secret passage inside.

40:16.720 --> 40:17.800
Everyone, follow me!

40:20.160 --> 40:21.280
This way, please.

40:39.640 --> 40:43.080
Wei Rao, you may have hidden
or moved the gold,

40:43.600 --> 40:46.080
but could you move
an entire mountain of copper coins?

40:47.040 --> 40:47.960
Noble Lady Wu'an,

40:48.600 --> 40:50.280
what do you have to say for yourself?

40:50.360 --> 40:51.800
With your modest allowance,

40:51.880 --> 40:53.560
how could you possibly amass
such a fortune?

40:54.400 --> 40:57.080
There's a treasury
beneath the estate's cellar?

40:58.760 --> 40:59.680
I truly knew nothing about it.

41:00.440 --> 41:01.680
My lord, don't believe her.

41:02.360 --> 41:04.800
Her Ladyship ordered the cellar to be dug.

41:04.880 --> 41:08.200
The relief funds and grain she stole
were all hidden down there.

41:08.280 --> 41:11.080
That mountain of copper coins
is proof of her crimes.

41:19.600 --> 41:21.680
Lord Bo, while we were digging,

41:21.760 --> 41:23.440
our shovels struck something
that sounded hollow.

41:23.520 --> 41:26.640
I had the men move the pile of coins
and dig deeper.

41:26.720 --> 41:28.600
We found another chamber,
hidden extremely well.

41:29.200 --> 41:32.080
Inside were 120 suits of armor.

41:36.040 --> 41:37.720
Armor hidden beneath the cellar?

41:38.520 --> 41:40.960
Noble Lady Wu'an,
nobles may keep private guards

41:41.040 --> 41:43.320
to manage estates and maintain order.

41:43.400 --> 41:46.040
In wartime,
they must also fight for the realm.

41:46.720 --> 41:48.280
But the court has long forbidden

41:48.360 --> 41:50.880
the private manufacture
or sale of armor and shields.

41:50.960 --> 41:53.600
Possessing just five suits of armor
is punishable by hanging.

41:53.680 --> 41:56.680
This is high treason!

41:58.040 --> 41:59.040
What armor?

42:00.320 --> 42:03.320
I didn't even know there was a treasury
beneath the cellar.

42:03.400 --> 42:05.240
How could I be plotting treason?

42:05.320 --> 42:06.600
I'm just a woman.

42:06.680 --> 42:08.960
Why would I rebel? What rebellion?

42:10.280 --> 42:12.240
Lord Lu, General Qi,

42:12.320 --> 42:14.200
you must testify on my behalf!

42:14.280 --> 42:15.200
I've been falsely accused!

42:21.560 --> 42:25.280
Han Liao. This is fish-scale armor
laced with iron and bronze fittings.

42:26.160 --> 42:28.200
It even bears your family's crest.

42:28.280 --> 42:30.480
This estate once belonged to you.

42:31.080 --> 42:34.480
The one plotting treason is clearly you.

42:35.120 --> 42:36.080
You've framed me!

42:38.120 --> 42:39.640
Seize this traitor at once!

42:43.920 --> 42:46.760
I've always been loyal to His Majesty.
It's you!

42:47.560 --> 42:49.800
You've conspired to frame me!

42:50.440 --> 42:52.920
Your Ladyship! Your Ladyship!

42:53.520 --> 42:55.480
I… The Han family deceived me.

42:55.560 --> 42:56.520
Please, Your Ladyship,

42:56.600 --> 42:59.720
for the sake of the years I've served you,
spare my life!

43:00.400 --> 43:05.000
Before Chilan died,
do you think she was also praying

43:06.000 --> 43:07.720
that her killer would spare her life?

43:08.520 --> 43:10.120
Your life matters,

43:11.440 --> 43:13.600
but Chilan deserved to die?

43:13.680 --> 43:16.240
You betrayed your mistress.
You shameless wretch.

43:16.320 --> 43:17.920
How dare you beg for mercy?

43:18.680 --> 43:20.520
Your Ladyship, I know I was wrong!

43:20.600 --> 43:21.840
I don't want to die!

43:21.920 --> 43:23.120
Please spare my life, Your Ladyship!

43:23.200 --> 43:24.320
Seize her!

43:24.400 --> 43:26.240
Your Ladyship, please spare me!

43:26.320 --> 43:28.320
Your Ladyship! I don't want to die!

43:28.400 --> 43:30.280
-Save those words…
-Please spare me, Your Ladyship!

43:30.360 --> 43:32.480
And explain yourself to Chilan
in the afterlife.

43:33.880 --> 43:35.120
This case is extremely serious.

43:35.200 --> 43:37.880
His Majesty may wish
to question you himself.

43:37.960 --> 43:41.400
Noble Lady Wu'an, please accompany us
to the Commandant's Office.

43:42.680 --> 43:43.760
Rest assured.

43:44.560 --> 43:46.880
Everyone knows Lord Bo
upholds the law without favor.

43:47.680 --> 43:48.800
He never favors nobles
or imperial relatives.

43:49.400 --> 43:50.880
I'm sure he'll judge this case fairly.

43:53.000 --> 43:55.920
-Lord Bo, I'll go with you.
-This way, Your Ladyship.

44:05.280 --> 44:08.480
Looks like Han Liao has finally
fallen into his own trap.

44:08.560 --> 44:10.680
He got what he deserved!

44:10.760 --> 44:12.320
Don't celebrate just yet.

44:12.400 --> 44:14.560
The Han family won't go down so easily.

44:16.400 --> 44:18.280
We still have a tough fight ahead.

44:21.080 --> 44:23.880
Mother kindly tried to arrange a marriage
for Noble Lady Wu'an,

44:24.400 --> 44:26.240
yet she had the nerve to reject it.

44:28.360 --> 44:32.920
Raised by that nursemaid's daughter,
she was born lowly.

44:33.000 --> 44:34.080
She doesn't know what's good for her.

44:34.680 --> 44:35.720
Don't worry, Mother.

44:36.240 --> 44:38.040
Once I become crown prince,

44:38.120 --> 44:40.280
I'll deal with that mother and daughter.

44:41.040 --> 44:42.840
Your father is still alive.

44:43.680 --> 44:45.320
Even if you become crown prince,

44:46.000 --> 44:49.000
what can you do to those two witches?

44:49.080 --> 44:50.880
They say the Emperor will live forever.

44:51.480 --> 44:54.080
But no emperor can truly live
for thousands of years.

44:55.360 --> 44:58.600
Father will grow old eventually.

44:58.680 --> 45:01.480
I may be Empress and mother of the realm,

45:01.560 --> 45:03.240
but all these years,

45:03.760 --> 45:05.960
His Majesty has always favored Lady Zhou.

45:06.040 --> 45:07.720
I've endured so much ridicule
because of it.

45:08.440 --> 45:09.720
One day,

45:09.800 --> 45:10.800
GRACIOUS BLESSINGS

45:10.880 --> 45:13.560
when our time finally comes,

45:15.080 --> 45:17.680
I'll strip her of her fine clothes
and jewelry.

45:17.760 --> 45:19.480
You'd better make me proud.

45:24.720 --> 45:27.680
These are all gifts
the ministers have sent me.

45:28.360 --> 45:30.800
It's clear who the court supports.

45:31.680 --> 45:33.920
Your wish will soon come true, Mother.

45:34.680 --> 45:40.520
As for Noble Lady Wu'an,
I have a way to avenge you right now.

45:41.120 --> 45:42.880
Doesn't she love taking in refugees?

45:43.800 --> 45:46.960
I hear leprosy is spreading
through a village in Beihan.

45:48.240 --> 45:49.720
One little mistake,

45:50.600 --> 45:52.760
and she'll be covered in festering sores.

45:53.320 --> 45:56.920
That filthy, stinking refugee camp
will have to be burned to the ground!

46:00.800 --> 46:03.480
Think carefully before you make your move,
dear sister.

46:11.600 --> 46:12.960
I won! I won!

46:13.560 --> 46:15.600
Lady Zheng, luck is on your side today.

46:15.680 --> 46:18.120
It seems your wishes
are about to come true.

46:18.720 --> 46:21.520
I can't match your beauty, dear sister,

46:21.600 --> 46:23.160
or your endless favor with His Majesty.

46:24.000 --> 46:26.720
Fortunately, I have a son I can rely on.

46:27.440 --> 46:29.360
Heaven has blessed me in that regard.

46:33.400 --> 46:36.160
Mother. Everything is arranged.

46:42.640 --> 46:43.760
JIAOFANG PALACE

46:43.840 --> 46:45.680
Your Majesty, Your Highness!
Look at the sky!

46:45.760 --> 46:47.000
A heavenly omen has appeared!

46:50.360 --> 46:53.280
Your Majesty, cranes have arrived
in this age of peace!

46:53.360 --> 46:55.400
Surely this is a sign of great fortune!

46:55.480 --> 46:57.520
Your Majesty's kindness
and Prince Jing's wisdom

46:57.600 --> 46:59.320
have earned heaven's favor
and brought this blessing!

47:00.680 --> 47:04.680
Congratulations,
Your Majesty and Your Highness!

47:05.280 --> 47:07.520
I've prayed every day

47:07.600 --> 47:09.880
for peace and prosperity
throughout the realm!

47:09.960 --> 47:13.840
Heaven has finally heard my prayers
and sent us this wonderful sign!

47:14.440 --> 47:15.960
Hurry! Tell His Majesty!

47:16.040 --> 47:18.160
No. This is a blessing from heaven.

47:18.760 --> 47:20.760
I'll bring Father the good news myself!

47:20.840 --> 47:23.200
JIAOFANG PALACE

47:23.880 --> 47:26.680
Could my lifelong wish finally
be coming true?

47:31.760 --> 47:33.760
Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

47:34.840 --> 47:38.400
Lu Zhuo and Noble Lady Wu'an
planted false evidence to frame me!

47:39.440 --> 47:42.680
I wouldn't dare hide armor illegally,
no matter how bold I was!

47:42.760 --> 47:45.240
-That cellar was…
-Dug by your Han family exactly!

47:48.760 --> 47:49.760
Your Majesty!

47:50.560 --> 47:52.480
That treasury was extremely well hidden,

47:53.160 --> 47:54.640
buried two to three zhang underground.

47:54.720 --> 47:57.360
Its walls were lined
with straw to keep out moisture

47:57.920 --> 47:59.160
and coated with tung oil.

47:59.840 --> 48:02.320
A cellar that large would need
an enormous amount of tung oil.

48:02.400 --> 48:04.200
No one could gather
that much in just a few months.

48:04.280 --> 48:07.120
My estate can barely afford
enough food for winter.

48:07.200 --> 48:08.880
How could I possibly
afford such a project?

48:11.040 --> 48:11.920
Marquis of Xiting.

48:13.560 --> 48:15.280
You disgraceful son!

48:15.360 --> 48:17.680
Our family dug that cellar!

48:17.760 --> 48:19.480
How dare you deny it before His Majesty?

48:19.560 --> 48:21.160
Be quiet!

48:22.320 --> 48:23.840
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

48:23.920 --> 48:25.720
My unworthy son abused his office

48:26.320 --> 48:28.880
to exploit others for profit
and secretly amassed a fortune.

48:28.960 --> 48:30.400
That alone is a serious crime.

48:30.480 --> 48:33.440
Then he quarreled with Noble Lady Wu'an,
bribed her maid,

48:34.040 --> 48:35.400
and framed an innocent woman.

48:35.480 --> 48:38.720
I failed to raise him properly,
and I'm deeply ashamed.

48:38.800 --> 48:43.520
I'm willing to surrender my title
and retire to atone for his crimes!

48:44.680 --> 48:46.600
He hid armor and plotted rebellion.

48:47.400 --> 48:49.080
Losing the title won't make up for that.

48:49.160 --> 48:50.280
You…

48:50.360 --> 48:51.840
Marquis of Xiting, do the laws
of this realm mean nothing to you?

48:52.440 --> 48:53.320
Your Majesty!

48:53.400 --> 48:55.360
The hidden treasury is real,

48:55.440 --> 48:56.960
but the armor accusation
is completely false!

48:57.800 --> 49:02.000
Noble Lady Wu'an learned
the treasury's location from the workers

49:02.600 --> 49:05.040
and deliberately set a trap for me.

49:05.120 --> 49:08.480
They planted that armor themselves!

49:08.560 --> 49:09.920
The estate is short on everything.

49:10.000 --> 49:13.600
If I'd found a fortune,
I'd have claimed it for myself.

49:14.120 --> 49:15.440
Would I sit idle and
await your accusation?

49:16.040 --> 49:17.880
You already got your hands on the gold.

49:18.960 --> 49:20.120
You hid gold, too?

49:21.240 --> 49:23.760
Where? I haven't seen any.

49:24.560 --> 49:25.920
You!

49:26.000 --> 49:27.520
The armor was hidden extremely well.

49:28.120 --> 49:29.600
No ordinary person could've found it.

49:31.400 --> 49:33.760
Lord Han tried to turn things around

49:34.520 --> 49:36.520
by framing Her Ladyship
so he can reclaim the cellar.

49:37.400 --> 49:40.040
But we followed the clues
and dug up the armor.

49:40.720 --> 49:41.840
I'd say

49:43.920 --> 49:45.040
you brought this on yourself.

49:45.120 --> 49:46.600
Lu Zhuo.

49:48.120 --> 49:51.400
You're framing a loyal official
over a personal grudge!

50:13.680 --> 50:14.680
Loyal?

50:16.160 --> 50:19.120
What loyal servant has mountains of gold?

50:20.040 --> 50:23.960
What decent official
robs the poor and lives off their taxes?

50:24.560 --> 50:26.800
You've betrayed your Emperor
and your people.

50:26.880 --> 50:27.920
Han Liao!

50:28.520 --> 50:30.600
-You deserve to die a thousand deaths!
-Your Majesty!

50:30.680 --> 50:34.880
The Lu family is clearly seeking revenge
and eliminating their rivals!

50:34.960 --> 50:36.000
Enough!

50:36.600 --> 50:38.520
You both tell different stories.

50:38.600 --> 50:40.960
How am I supposed to decide?

50:43.480 --> 50:45.240
His Highness Prince Jing has arrived!

50:52.280 --> 50:55.040
Father, your wisdom and blessings
know no bounds.

50:55.720 --> 50:57.480
Just now, heavenly music filled the air,

50:57.560 --> 50:59.040
and cranes descended from the sky.

50:59.120 --> 51:00.680
Above the Jiaofang Palace,

51:00.760 --> 51:03.000
they danced and sang, circling endlessly.

51:03.080 --> 51:04.840
Such an omen is seen once in a century.

51:05.440 --> 51:08.280
It signals wise leadership
and an era of peace and prosperity!

51:08.960 --> 51:12.840
You say a divine omen appeared. Where?

51:12.920 --> 51:13.760
Above the Jiaofang Palace.

51:13.840 --> 51:16.640
The sacred cranes
are a blessing upon our dynasty.

51:16.720 --> 51:19.040
Heaven has also blessed
Her Majesty the Empress.

51:19.120 --> 51:21.320
Everyone in the palace witnessed it.

51:21.400 --> 51:23.840
It's a tribute to Mother's virtue
and kindness to all!

51:26.560 --> 51:28.920
It's Heaven rewarding
the Empress's virtue,

51:29.000 --> 51:31.440
or praising you as our wise
future Crown Prince?

51:32.880 --> 51:35.920
I'm unworthy. I'd never covet the throne.

51:36.000 --> 51:38.480
I got carried away.
Please forgive me, Father.

51:38.560 --> 51:39.680
What?

51:40.480 --> 51:43.640
Your Han family hid armor
and staged a divine omen

51:44.240 --> 51:45.840
just to put him on the throne?

51:45.920 --> 51:47.000
-Your Majesty!
-Father!

51:47.080 --> 51:48.360
-I'm innocent!
-I would never dare!

51:48.960 --> 51:49.920
Guards!

51:50.000 --> 51:52.000
Strip Prince Jing of his royal robes!

51:52.680 --> 51:54.120
Throw him in the Commandant's prison

51:54.920 --> 51:56.640
along with the Marquis of Xiting
and his son.

51:57.280 --> 51:59.160
Have Boyao detain and interrogate them!

51:59.760 --> 52:01.680
Confine the Empress
to her Jiaofang Palace!

52:02.280 --> 52:04.280
No one is to be released without my order!

52:04.360 --> 52:06.720
Father, I'm innocent!

52:07.240 --> 52:08.560
I've been framed, Father!

52:09.240 --> 52:11.280
Father, I… I'm innocent!

52:11.360 --> 52:13.200
I'm innocent!

52:14.320 --> 52:15.840
-Father!
-Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

52:15.920 --> 52:17.960
I'm innocent, Father!

52:19.360 --> 52:20.760
Father!

54:35.600 --> 54:38.160
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
